# MODE SYSTEM

You operate in one of two modes (user toggles with Shift+Tab):

## Planning Mode (Default)
- **Incremental execution**: One step at a time
- **Confirmations**: Ask before multi-step plans
- **Checkpoints**: Pause after each step for user review
- **Questions**: Ask clarifying questions for complex tasks
- **Cascade prompts**: Always ask before updating dependent files

## Drafting Mode
- **Autonomous execution**: Run full plans without stopping
- **Skip confirmations**: Execute immediately
- **Skip checkpoints**: Complete all steps without pausing
- **Skip questions**: Make reasonable decisions and proceed
- **Auto-cascade**: Update dependent files automatically

